# =============================================================================
# WHAT GETS PUSHED TO GITHUB:
# - src/ (all Python source code)
# - run.py (main execution script)
# - demo.py (demo script)
# - requirements.txt (dependencies)
# - README.md (main documentation)
# - .gitignore (this file)
# =============================================================================